stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> prepared: start pins evidence / version 0
    prepared --> draft_running: atomic attempt reservation / version 1
    draft_running --> draft_ready: succeeded run / version 2
    draft_running --> failed: failed run and safe error code
    draft_running --> draft_running: unknown outcome / no provider replay
    draft_ready --> completed: local schema and citation checks / version 3
    completed --> completed: resume returns stored review packet
    completed --> [*]: human review remains required
    failed --> [*]: no automatic retry
